{
  "_createdAt": "2026-04-27T19:04:27Z",
  "_id": "wp-post-152426-en",
  "_rev": "dJ4ZpMyfIFtQ0D7lyxWvAF",
  "_type": "article",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-07-05T14:25:02Z",
  "author": {
    "_ref": "author-legacy-archive",
    "_type": "reference"
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "000000000001",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "g12xnny7laco",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "eihmlfefvwoj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "dhim2v875k5i"
          ],
          "text": "Giza"
        },
        {
          "_key": "w43u2wgjfop6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " pyramids are one of Egypt's strongest places."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "dhim2v875k5i",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000003",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000002",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "They are also one of the most tiring for first-time travellers. The reason isn't the site itself. Entrances, transfers, camel rides, unofficial guides, photos, souvenirs, offers of help. Small businesses dealing with tourists cluster around the pyramids."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000005",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7j6bmcx5qabr",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This doesn't mean danger. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "7di1whry9x8w",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "7jlesqql6n64"
          ],
          "text": "The Giza plateau"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3h3or7k7d96z",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is patrolled as a tourist site and many travellers visit every day. The problem is commercial pressure."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "7jlesqql6n64",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.giza.the-giza-plateau",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000007",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To visit well, what's needed isn't suspicion. Know the system, decline what should be declined briefly, and choose only what you need."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000009",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "First, tickets and entrances"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The first thing at Giza is buying tickets through official routes."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At present, Giza plateau tickets can be bought at official ticket windows, on-site self-service machines, or through the Ministry of Tourism and Antiquities' official online ticketing site "
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "egymonuments.com"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Prices change — don't take old blog or third-party numbers at face value."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000011",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The standard entry ticket admits you to the plateau, the pyramid exteriors, and the Sphinx area. Interior entry to Khufu's Great Pyramid, Khafre's, or Menkaure's pyramids can require separate tickets."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000013",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If someone outside the gate says \"buy here,\" \"this is faster,\" or \"today you specially need this,\" there is no need to buy tickets anywhere other than official windows or the official site. With QR-code e-tickets, buy through official routes and have the screen or screenshot ready to show."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000015",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How you arrive changes the tiredness"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000017",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "wqlbkmoiaaoz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "From a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c2g8l3yfetir",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "zspx7bplyy62"
          ],
          "text": "Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "dlux050x28ba",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " or Giza hotel, using a ride-hailing app or a pre-arranged car cuts the first negotiations."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "zspx7bplyy62",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000019",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Tell a taxi only \"the pyramids\" and which entrance, where you stop along the way, and who you're handed off to becomes vague. Decide your entrance in advance. Many use the Sphinx-side entrance, building a flow from Sphinx and valley temple up to the pyramids."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pickup or \"cheap car with guide\" offers in front of hotels, at stations, or on the road can end up tied to souvenir shops, perfume shops, papyrus shops, and camel rides. Not all are bad; for a first visitor, hard to judge."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Decide driver, fare, destination, and waiting time from the start. Easier at Giza."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Free\" is not free"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000021",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The most frequent friction at Giza isn't outright scam — it starts from vague kindness."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000023",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A small souvenir placed in your hand. A photo taken for you. Being guided to the entrance. \"It's closed here.\" A short sit on a camel. Being led to a good photo spot near the Sphinx."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000025",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You may hear \"free,\" \"friend,\" \"no problem.\" Usually, a tip or fee is asked later."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000027",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The response is simple. Don't accept. Don't ride. Don't follow. If unneeded, decline briefly and keep walking."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000029",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In English, \"No, thank you.\" In Arabic, \"La, shukran.\" That is enough. Over-explain and the conversation continues."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You don't need to be cold. Brief, calm, the same answer repeated."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Watch for unofficial guides"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Giza has genuinely knowledgeable licensed guides."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000031",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000030",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "There are also people who suddenly speak to you at the entrance or on the plateau and start guiding. They may say \"official,\" \"I work here,\" \"included in your ticket.\" If you didn't arrange in advance, treat with caution."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000033",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000032",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you want a guide, arrange in advance. Decide fare, time, language, and what is included. Confirm they are licensed."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000035",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000034",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Giza is a place where a good guide really deepens understanding. Pyramids, funerary complex, Sphinx, valley temple, the solar boat, the workers' town — with explanation, the plateau reads."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000037",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000036",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Don't let someone who attaches themselves on the spot become your guide. The fee negotiation afterwards usually becomes unpleasant."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000039",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000038",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Camels and horses — decide everything before you ride"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Camel rides and horse-drawn carriages can be enjoyed as part of Giza."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The problem isn't whether to ride. It is whether you set conditions before riding."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Fare, time, route, round trip or one way, are photos included, are tips included. Confirm all before riding. Set the amount clearly in Egyptian pounds and have small notes ready."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000041",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000040",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The common problem is showing a low price first and asking for extras after the return. \"Tip for the camel.\" \"Photo fee.\" \"Extra for going further.\" \"Extra for waiting.\""
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000043",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000042",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You don't have to pay more than the amount agreed before riding. You can add a tip for good service by your own judgment; not because it was requested."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000045",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000044",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Look at the animals too. Tired, thin, roughly handled — it is fine not to ride."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000047",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000046",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Set expectations for the pyramid interior"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000049",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8fetv1jc1k8k",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Entering "
        },
        {
          "_key": "11r1st139lcl",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "nsw8nlvgamhk"
          ],
          "text": "the Great Pyramid of Khufu"
        },
        {
          "_key": "fbl18y4bk26n",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is special."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "nsw8nlvgamhk",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.giza.the-great-pyramid-of-khufu",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Not a comfortable visit. Passages are narrow, low, and steep, the interior is hot, and the air is close. For people with claustrophobia, knee or back concerns, or breathing concerns, it may not fit."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "There are no wall paintings or treasures inside. A very simple, physical experience — see the King's Chamber and the sarcophagus."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Still, going up by your own body through the interior of one of the ancient world's largest stone buildings has worth. If entering, early morning is best. In busy periods, passing in the narrow passage is also a load."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000051",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000050",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The solar boat is at the museum, not the plateau"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000053",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000052",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Previously, Khufu's solar boat could be seen at a dedicated museum on the Giza plateau."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000055",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000054",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Now, that boat has been moved to the Grand Egyptian Museum. Searching on the plateau won't find it as before. To see it together with the pyramids, plan a separate visit to the Grand Egyptian Museum."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000057",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000056",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This matters. Searching on the plateau on old information wastes time."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000059",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000058",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To deepen Giza, combine the pyramid plateau and the Grand Egyptian Museum on the same day or consecutive days — understanding connects."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Whether to go to the panorama point"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The famous photo of the three pyramids in line is often taken from a panorama point west or southwest on the plateau."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You can walk, but the distance is long, shade is scarce, and summer is severe. If using car, camel, or carriage, always set the fare and return method first."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000061",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000060",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The panorama point is strong for photos and attracts more touts. Help with photos, camel-and-you photos, \"special angle\" guidance — extra offers multiply. If unneeded, again, decline briefly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000063",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000062",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If photos are the only purpose, a short stay is enough. Not a place to linger in heat."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000065",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000064",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What to bring"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000067",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000066",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Carry more water than you think. The plateau is wide, shade is scarce, and you walk more than expected. You can buy water on-site, but prices run high."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000069",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000068",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Wear shoes that walk well. Sand, stone, slopes, and steps. If you enter the pyramid, the more anti-slip the better."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Have small notes. For tips, drinks, small payments. With large notes alone, change becomes awkward."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Hat, sunscreen, light long sleeve help. Sun is strong even in winter. In summer, plan to avoid the times outside just after opening."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When to visit"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000071",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000070",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Morning is best."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000073",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000072",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Just after opening, it is still cool, light is good, fewer people. For the Great Pyramid interior especially, earlier is better. As morning goes on, groups arrive and the heat strengthens."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000075",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000074",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Evening light is also beautiful; for a first visit with care for detail, morning is more practical. For a short photo-only stop, evening is an option."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000077",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000076",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In summer, avoid around noon. Giza's heat isn't only temperature — radiation off stone and sand drains you."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000079",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000078",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In sum"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000007b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000007a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Giza pyramids are too large a place to judge by touts and negotiation alone."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000007d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000007c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "But go unprepared and the commercial pressure tires you, eating into the focus to see the pyramids themselves."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000007f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000007e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Use official tickets. Decide entrance and transfer. Don't accept free offers. Set conditions before riding camels or horses. Choose a guide in advance. Go in the morning."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000081",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000080",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "That much changes the experience a lot."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000083",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000082",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Giza is not a dangerous place. It is a slightly busy place for walking without knowing anything. Pass the first 30 minutes calmly and what you came for is there."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000085",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000084",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A stone plateau that has stood at the edge of a city for more than four thousand years."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
